    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/cupcake-shop/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Cupcake Shop is an elegantly designed, user-friendly, and fully responsive theme tailored for various dessert-focused businesses, including bakeries, cake shops, pastry catering, and more. Whether you own a charming local bakery, a home-based cake business, or an online dessert store, this theme provides a stylish layout perfect for showcasing an array of delicious products like custom cakes, birthday cakes, and pastries. With its clean code, fast loading times, and mobile-friendly design, it ensures a smooth browsing experience across all devices. The theme includes visually appealing features such as image galleries, product sliders, and seasonal collections, along with easy customization options for banners and colors, all without requiring coding knowledge. Additionally, it integrates tools like WP Cafe for menu management and reservations, while being SEO-friendly to enhance search visibility and attract local customers, making The Cupcake Shop an excellent choice for elevating your cake shop or bakery business."
    },
